{"root":"telah","ipa":"/təlah/","core":"表示动作已经完成，相当于英语中的 already，用于强调事情发生的时间点在过去或当前时刻之前。","pos":["虚词"],"scenes":["高频","工作","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/təlah/","zh":"已经","phrases":[{"t":"telah selesai","zh":"已经完成"},{"t":"telah tiba","zh":"已经到达"},{"t":"telah lama","zh":"已经很久了"}],"examples":[{"t":"Dia telah pergi ke kantor.","zh":"他已经去办公室了。"},{"t":"Kami telah makan siang.","zh":"我们已经吃过午饭了。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"telah","ipa":"/təlah/","zh":"已经","phrase":{"t":"telah terjadi","zh":"已经发生"},"example":{"t":"Masalah itu telah diatasi.","zh":"那个问题已经解决了。"}},{"w":"setelah","ipa":"/sətəlah/","zh":"在...之后","phrase":{"t":"setelah itu","zh":"在那之后"},"example":{"t":"Setelah makan, saya akan pergi.","zh":"吃完饭后，我就要走了。"}},{"w":"setelahnya","ipa":"/sətəlahɲa/","zh":"其后，随后","phrase":{"t":"dan setelahnya","zh":"以及随后"},"example":{"t":"Dia pergi dan setelahnya tidak kembali.","zh":"他走了，随后就没有再回来。"}}],"derSlugs":["telah","setelah","setelahnya"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-25T09:14:42.008Z","src":"base"}